Package: JavaGD
Version: 0.6-6
Title: Java Graphics Device
Authors@R: person("Simon", "Urbanek", role=c("aut","cre","cph"), email="Simon.Urbanek@R-project.org", comment=c("https://urbanek.nz", ORCID="0000-0003-2297-1732"))
Maintainer: Simon Urbanek <Simon.Urbanek@R-project.org>
Depends: R (>= 2.4.0)
Imports: rJava (>= 0.5-0), grDevices, graphics
Description: Graphics device routing all graphics commands to a Java
	     program. The actual functionality of the JavaGD depends
	     on the Java-side implementation. Simple AWT and Swing
	     implementations are included.
